      "text": "MEET-001 requires 60 min, required attendees Hayden and Sasha, candidate windows Monday 10:00-11:00, Monday 11:00-12:00, Tuesday 10:00-11:00, Wednesday 10:00-11:00, candidate room atlas, priority high.\nMEET-002 requires 60 min, required attendee Avi, candidate window Wednesday 15:00-16:00, candidate room delta, priority low.\nHayden is available Monday 10:00-11:00 and Tuesday 10:00-11:00.\nSasha is available Wednesday 10:00-11:00.\nAvi is available Wednesday 15:00-16:00.\nRoom atlas capacity 4.\nRoom delta capacity 8.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schedule\": {\n    \"MEET-001\": {\n      \"slot\": \"Tuesday 10:00-11:00\",\n      \"room\": \"atlas\"\n    },\n    \"MEET-002\": {\n      \"slot\": \"Wednesday 15:00-16:00\",\n      \"room\": \"delta\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nExplanation:\n- For MEET-001, the candidate room is `atlas` (capacity 4), and required attendees are Hayden and Sasha. Hayden is available on Monday 10:00-11:00 and Tuesday 10:00-11:00. Sasha is available on Wednesday 10:00-11:00. Since Monday windows don't work for Sasha and Wednesday does not work for Hayden, Tuesday 10:00-11:00 is the only overlapping slot where both Hayden and Sasha are available.\n- For MEET-002, the candidate room is `delta`, required attendee is Avi, and the only candidate window is Wednesday 15:00-16:00, during which Avi is available.",
